{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/974633-clown-epidemic","id":974633,"title":"Clown Epidemic","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-09-22T13:25:25-07:00","id":974633,"title":"Clown Epidemic","content":"<a href=\"http://www.pennlive.com/news/2016/09/spooky_clown_sightings_unsettl.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.pennlive.com/news/2016/09...s_unsettl.html</a><br /> <br /> Good citizens of the ChroD, I'm assuming I'm probably not the only one here paying attention to the sudden explosion in &quot;creepy clown sightings&quot; across the US. Putting aside rational explanations for a moment and embracing the macabre, what do you think is &quot;really&quot; going on?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2507-caitiff-primogen","name":"Caitiff Primogen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2507_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-22T13:42:23-07:00","id":974641,"title":"","content":"Self-Propagating Horror, obviously.<br /> <br /> Either that, or an Unchained screwed up royally with Urban Legend.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2