tainer\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/974633-clown-epidemic?p=976524#post976524\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I really like that. Having seen 31 recently, I could really see a sort of traveling pack of clowns who create bizarre, scary and chaotic hunts.</div> </div> </div> </div><img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> I meant it as a joke, but I could see it being creepy story fodder. Werewolves by way of backwaters redneckery. They're trying to lure the authorities out into the woods to hunt them, maybe.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8492-dxanders","name":"dxanders","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"378"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-26T08:32:32-07:00","id":976540,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>dxanders</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/974633-clown-epidemic?p=976533#post976533\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> I meant it as a joke, but I could see it being creepy story fodder. Werewolves by way of backwaters redneckery. They're trying to lure the authorities out into the woods to hunt them, maybe.</div> </div> </div> </div>In 31, the clownishness was just a motif they wore during their killing, it was more about Slashers but I could easily see werewolves doing the same. There was also ClownTown, about a down on its luck town where some youths with no hope for the future just went the Joker way, dressing up, luring and killing people who passed through.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-02T14:40:21-07:00","id":980433,"title":"","content":"The clowns are actually an experiment in Goetia bringing elements from the Astral domains created by reading &quot;It.&quot; With the new movie coming out, the &quot;It&quot; domains connection are strengthened, allowing greater manifestations to arise.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1407-endlesskng","name":"EndlessKng","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"335"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-03T08:51:07-07:00","id":980792,"title":"","content":"Actually they're a worse horror than anything in this forum.<br /> <br /> They're a bad viral marketing ploy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","use