":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"213"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-09T11:29:23-07:00","id":984522,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/974633-clown-epidemic?p=980870#post980870\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It started out that way. But some of the actors stumbled across an Idigam, which Coalesced around the concept of murder clowns and used Forge Servant to jam murder spirits into some of them, and to turn others into Heralds to bring it more victims to forge into servants.</div> </div> </div> </div>Or maybe they're not human at all, just Jagglings of real murders and the slasher film genre that have been propagating due to the violence in the US.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2456-zeroninja","name":"zeroninja","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2456_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"87"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-09T11:44:51-07:00","id":984530,"title":"","content":"or maybe they are some sort of a Hunter Conspiracy which use the clowns in order to test if a potential recruit is fir for the Vigil- that is, is she escape, she is not. If she runs them over with her car or beat them up with a bat, she is.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=S